(P,"Founders by David Senra (the show)","David Senra","https://www.founderspodcast.com/",60,["founders","history"],["Biographies are compressed experience.","Great founders are obsessive about product and taste.","Steal ideas from history."],"Which founder biography should you read after Horowitz?"),
